OL,3,GNEWSA'They gave us no warning - it was
OL,4,Athe worst day of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers who lost their jobs when a food
OL,7,Fcompany went into administration said
OL,8,Fthey were given no notice prior to its
OL,9,Fcollapse.
OL,11,FMore than 650 people were made
OL,12,Fredundant after Kanes Foods, near
OL,13,FEvesham, was declared insolvent on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FThe BBC has spoken to several
OL,17,Fex-employees, who said they received an
OL,18,Femail on Monday afternoon telling them
OL,19,Fnot to turn up the next day.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
