OL,3,GNEWSA'They gave us no warning - it was
OL,4,Athe worst day of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStoyan Paskov, a 34-year-old father,
OL,7,Fsaid: "They gave us no warning - it was
OL,8,Fthe worst day of my life."
